                  <Button Name="GrantBenefitsButton" Content="福利下发" IsEnabled="False" Background="#28402F" BorderBrush="#4F8B63" ToolTip="从安装数据中选择货币或素材，并向选中账号追加指定数量" Click="GrantBenefitsButton_OnClick" />
